{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05263","headline":"奉和九日幸临渭亭登高应制 · 赵彦昭","name":"奉和九日幸临渭亭登高应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋豫凝仙览，宸游转翠华。\n呼鹰下鸟路，戏马出龙沙。\n紫菊宜新寿，丹萸辟旧邪。\n须陪长久宴，岁岁奉吹花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵彦昭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05263.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05263","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}